          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edaun ekaru ŋol, apotu ŋasigarya ka Aram kitipeut akitijiore Yoas. Toloto ikes Yudaya ka Yerusalem, tomunyasi ŋikarikok daadaŋ ŋulu a ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka Yeruselam. Kiyakiyasi Damasko neni a erwosit kec ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu kepotu ikes toŋatut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari daŋ ŋina aponitotor ŋasigarya ŋuna ka Aram ekudyoko, abu Ekapolon inak ikes akiloun ŋasigarya ŋuna alalak, anerae apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya toŋero Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa kec. Alopite a ŋol, aponi erwosit Yoas kisicanae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
